elevenlabs_api = "0.1.0"
clipboard = "0.7.0"
tokio = { version = "1", features = ["full"] }
```
2. Set the `ELEVENLABS_API_KEY` environment variable to your ElevenLabs API key.
3. Run the code using `cargo run`.

